Same issue ; I have a permissionRequest hook whick works with agents and is never fired in teams :

```
		"PermissionRequest": [
			{
				"matcher": "^(?!ExitPlanMode$|AskUserQuestion$).*",
				"hooks": [
					{
						"type": "command",
						"command": "node .claude/hooks/permission-check.mjs"
					}
				]
			}
		]
```
